{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日，蘋果首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo正式發售。據悉，10月16日晚8點開啓預購後，首批貨源很快售罄，目前蘋果中國官網部分訂單的預計交付時間已經排到2027年1月下旬。截至10月23日上午8點，得物App顯示，預售一周後，iPhone Duo各容量版本的加價空間均明顯收窄，多個版本縮水幅度接近五成。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583504.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:21.952409+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_hash":"1eee662d8ed05c8ab28c640e824fdce56dcafb46f4ac454bc31a3dc38223933a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}